                                "sense_id": "99d85b9b-0d57-31f1-97ab-4ecec4ff5200",
                                "text": "Nor does he beat around the bush: Tocqueville’s cousin and confidant Louis de Kergorlay is “a young idiot” and the legitimist insurrectionist the Duchesse de Berry “one of the silliest princesses in all European history.”"
